	Description		"Quadrotor control mixer"
	Help			"Determine rotor speeds based on desired torques and thrust.\n \n<b>Inputs::</b>\n \ntau pitch (1x1)  desired "
	"pitching torque [Nm]\ntau roll (1x1)   desired rolling torque [Nm]\ntau yaw (1x1)    desired yawing torque [Nm]\nT (1"
	"x1)          desired thrust [N]\n \n<b>Outputs::</b>\n \nw1 (1x1) angular velocity of rotor 1 [rad]\nw2 (1x1) angular"
	" velocity of rotor 2 [rad]\nw3 (1x1) angular velocity of rotor 3 [rad]\nw4 (1x1) angular velocity of rotor 4 [rad]\n "
	"\n<b>Notes::</b>\n \n- Assumes the rotor labelling convention of RVC Fig 4.16.\n- The quadrotor is underactuated and "
	"has only 4 inputs.\n"
      }
